h soldiers]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"british-bottom-text\">\n      Though formally 'independent', Britain CONTINUES to exert influence and control through\n      <ul>\n        <li>Domination of the economies</li>\n        <li>Collaboration with the repressive regimes</li>\n        <li>Cultural subversion</li>\n        <li>Five-Power-Defence-Arrangement (U.K., Australia, New Zealand, Malaysia and Singapore).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-section\">\n    <div class=\"bottom-title\">BELIEVED TO BE IN LONDON ATTENDING<br>THE COMMONWEALTH P.M. CONF.</div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-date\">JUNE 8-16, 1977</div>\n\n    <div class=\"publisher-info\">\n      Published by COBRA and NUS<br>\n      COBRA - Conference for Basic Human and Democratic Rights in the ASEAN alliance<br>\n      6, Endsleigh Street London WC1\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"picket-diagonal\">\n      <div class=\"picket-title\">PICKET LEE AND HUSSEIN ONN</div>\n      <p>Place: Parliament Square, London SW1</p>\n      <p>Date: 9th June 1977</p>\n      <p>Time: 5 to 9 p.m.</p>\n      <p>SEND LETTERS/TELEGRAMS of protest<br>\n      c/o Commonwealth Secretariat,<br>\n      Marlborough House,<br>\n      London SW1.</p>\n      <p>Copies to COBRA.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
